OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787042885
OL,3,CBritish newlyweds killed in helicopter
OL,4,Ccrash on Greek island, local media says
OL,6,FLocal authorities said the cause of
OL,7,Fthe crash was not immediately clear
OL,9,FA British couple celebrating their
OL,10,Fhoneymoon were killed alongside their
OL,11,Fpilot in a helicopter crash on a Greek
OL,12,Fisland, according to local media.
OL,14,FThe private helicopter crashed on the
OL,15,Fpopular Greek tourist island of Sifnos
OL,16,Fon Monday, killing all three people on
OL,17,Fboard.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/3
