OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787042885
OL,3,CBritish newlyweds killed in helicopter
OL,4,Ccrash on Greek island, local media says
OL,6,FThe crash sparked a fire in the Tholos
OL,7,Fpart of Sifnos, the fire department
OL,8,Fsaid, and three bodies were recovered
OL,9,Ffrom the site.
OL,11,FSKAI, a major Greek TV network and
OL,12,Fmedia group, said the helicopter took
OL,13,Foff from Markopoulo, near Athens, and
OL,14,Fwas scheduled to arrive in Sifnos at
OL,15,F6.15pm.
OL,17,FThe cause of the crash was not
OL,18,Fimmediately clear.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/3
