OL,3,CBritish newlyweds killed in helicopter
OL,4,Ccrash on Greek island, local media says
OL,6,FThe UK Foreign Office told ITV News:
OL,7,F"We are in contact with the local
OL,8,Fauthorities and are urgently seeking
OL,9,Ffurther information.
OL,11,F"Our staff stand ready to provide
OL,12,Fconsular support to those affected."
